{title: 'Tis So Sweet to Trust in Jesus}
{title_ko: 구주 예수 의지함이}
{hymnal: 새찬송가 542장}
{artist: Louisa M. R. Stead / William J. Kirkpatrick}
{genre: Gospel}
{flow: Meditative}
{style: Traditional}
{key: G}
{tempo: 76}
{time: 4/4}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
'Tis so [G]sweet to trust in [C]Jesus
Just to [G]take Him at His [D7]word
Just to [G]rest upon His [C]promise
Just to [G]know, "Thus saith the [D7]Lord[G]"
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[G]Jesus, Jesus, how I [C]trust Him
How I've [G]proved Him o'er and [D7]o'er
[G]Jesus, Jesus, precious [C]Jesus
O for [G]grace to trust Him [D7]more[G]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
O how [G]sweet to trust in [C]Jesus
Just to [G]trust His cleansing [D7]blood
And in [G]simple faith to [C]plunge me
'Neath the [G]healing, cleansing [D7]flood[G]
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
Yes, 'tis [G]sweet to trust in [C]Jesus
Just from [G]sin and self to [D7]cease
Just from [G]Jesus simply [C]taking
Life and [G]rest, and joy and [D7]peace[G]
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
I'm so [G]glad I learned to [C]trust Thee
Precious [G]Jesus, Saviour, [D7]Friend
And I [G]know that Thou art [C]with me
Wilt be [G]with me to the [D7]end[G]
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}
